  "longBusinessSummary": "JK Tyre & Industries Limited develops, manufactures, markets and distributes automotive tyres, tubes, flaps, and retreads in India, and internationally. The company offers tyres for truck/bus radial and bias, light and small commercial vehicle bias, two/three-wheeler, farm radial and bias, off-the-road and industrial, racing, light and small commercial vehicle radical, passenger/SUV/MUV radial, specialty, and military/defence. It also operates tyre care centers; and provides fleet management and mobility solutions. The company markets its products and services through a network of Steel Wheels, Xpress Wheels, and Truck Wheels, as well as brand shops. JK Tyre & Industries Limited was incorporated in 1951 and is headquartered in New Delhi, India.",
